{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわんわぁ〜(*´ω｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃ-だよん♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/01/18/2305186/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チークも まつ毛も 眉毛も...\n色々としてないから顔に色見がない ＼(^^)／ ポジティブ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・・・・・・・・・・・・・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ムムムッ!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃ-の 左足の反射神経が働きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分で自分のベッドをおもいっきり蹴ってしまったよ.\nもちろん痛いです=・ω・="},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今こんな顔です？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/01/18/2305186/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スキニーパンツを温めてて\n履こうと思って 足を入れた瞬間\nチャックの部分が めちゃ熱くなってまして\n『あつっΣ(*Σ*;)』 となりまして\nその流れでスキニーを前に投げて、足を後ろに引いた訳ですよ、、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら ベッドの固い部分にうちました。\nチーン.♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも大丈夫!、すぐに治るもん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人間にはイモリのシッポの様な素晴らしい再生能力を 兼ね備えてる生き物だからね\\(・ω・)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へーい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さあっ!  今日も早起きしたから\nろってぃ-は 眠いです♪ヽ(´▽｀)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっきまで半分寝てました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので ドーナッツを買いに行きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ〜〜、そーだそーだ。\n明日 握手会皆よろちくねぇ〜＼(^-^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしてます..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃ-のこといじめないでね？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良しこよちっ よろしくね 大好き!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( 〃▽〃)  のし"}],"source":"archive"}